{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39839","headline":"寄贺杜荀鹤及第 · 殷文圭","name":"寄贺杜荀鹤及第","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一战平畴五字劳，昼归乡去锦爲袍。\n大鹏出海翎犹湿，骏马辞天气正豪。\n九子旧山增秀绝，二南新格变风骚。\n由来稽古符公道，平地丹梯甲乙高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷文圭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}